MedEnv

This distribution packages and adapts the MedGym OSCE evaluation workflow from
a supplied local rLLM source tree (project metadata version 0.2.1).
The supplied source LICENSE is Apache License 2.0 and is retained in full.
No source Git history or upstream commit identifier was present.

Derived files under rllm/, medenv/data.py, services/, and selected scripts/
carry adaptation notices. Source paths and SHA-256 fingerprints are recorded
in docs/source_manifest.json. Packaging and runtime changes are documented
in docs/CHANGES.md. Original notices, where present, are retained.

The upstream pyproject metadata used an MIT identifier inconsistent with the
supplied Apache-2.0 LICENSE. This distribution follows the supplied LICENSE.

Patient data, retrieval corpora, indexes and model weights are not licensed
by this code license. Their respective access and license terms apply.
See docs/DATA.md for excluded assets and upstream sources.
